### Money Tracker API — готовые запросы для VS Code REST Client / Thunder Client
###
### Перед запуском убедитесь, что dev-сервер поднят:  npm run dev
### Базовый URL приложения:
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Прямой доступ к Supabase REST (PostgREST) — для сравнения с Server Actions / API Route.
@supabaseUrl = https://fpcecyscygefrblgiyst.supabase.co
@supabaseKey = sb_publishable_KZWK3nyC60NwHGOJHGrd9w_NikCf6sU

############################################################
# 1. Внутренний API Route  (Next.js Route Handler)
############################################################

### 1.1 GET всех транзакций
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 GET только доходов
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?type=income
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 GET только расходов
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?type=expense
Accept: application/json

### 1.4 POST — создать транзакцию
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "expense",
  "amount": 750,
  "category": "Еда",
  "description": "Кофе и булка",
  "date": "2026-05-12"
}

### 1.5 POST — невалидный ввод (ожидаем 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "invalid",
  "amount": 0,
  "category": "Нет такой",
  "date": "12.05.2026"
}

### 1.6 GET одну транзакцию по id (замените id ниже)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/1
Accept: application/json

### 1.7 PATCH — обновить транзакцию
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Зарплата за май",
  "amount": 68000
}

### 1.8 DELETE — удалить транзакцию (ожидаем 204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/99999

### 1.9 DELETE — несуществующий id (ожидаем 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/99999999

############################################################
# 2. Supabase REST (PostgREST) — для сравнения подходов
############################################################

### 2.1 SELECT * FROM transactions ORDER BY date DESC
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/transactions?select=*&order=date.desc
apikey: {{supabaseKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{supabaseKey}}

### 2.2 SELECT … WHERE type = 'income'
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/transactions?type=eq.income&select=*
apikey: {{supabaseKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{supabaseKey}}

### 2.3 INSERT
POST {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/transactions
apikey: {{supabaseKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{supabaseKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Prefer: return=representation

{
  "type": "income",
  "amount": 1500,
  "category": "Фриланс",
  "description": "Мелкая правка сайта",
  "date": "2026-05-12"
}

### 2.4 UPDATE
PATCH {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/transactions?id=eq.1
apikey: {{supabaseKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{supabaseKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Prefer: return=representation

{
  "description": "Зарплата за май"
}

### 2.5 DELETE
DELETE {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/transactions?id=eq.99999
apikey: {{supabaseKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{supabaseKey}}
